--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename ``TTLCache.expire()`` and ``TLRUCache.expire()`` parameter
+  ``time`` to ``now``.  The ``time`` keyword argument is deprecated,
+  but still accepted (without emitting a warning).
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
